  id: JuggernautSkill
  skillName: Blood Counter
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  skilDesc: "\"\u2022 H\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng: Gi\u01A1 v\u0169 kh\xED th\u1EE7 th\u1EBF
    (Stance) trong 3 gi\xE2y, t\u0103ng 150 Defense Value (gi\u1EA3m kho\u1EA3ng
    50% damage), t\u1ECFa kh\xED \u0111\u1ECF quanh ng\u01B0\u1EDDi.\n\n\u2022 Hi\u1EC7u
    \u1EE9ng: N\u1EBFu b\u1ECB \u0111\xE1nh tr\xFAng, k\u1EBFt th\xFAc hi\u1EC7u
    \u1EE9ng, ph\u1EA3n \u0111\xF2n qu\xE9t ngang, g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    l\u1EDBn scale th\xEAm Armor v\xE0 MS v\xE0 l\xE0m cho\xE1ng. M\xE1u c\xE0ng
    th\u1EA5p, t\u1EA7m qu\xE9t c\xE0ng r\u1ED9ng v\xE0 l\u1EF1c \u0111\u1EA9y c\xE0ng
    m\u1EA1nh.\n H\u1ED3i l\u1EA1i m\xE1u d\u1EF1a tr\xEAn s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    g\xE2y ra, t\u1ED1i \u0111a 30% M\xE1u t\u1ED1i \u0111a. T\u0103ng 20% t\u1ED1c
    \u0111\u1ED9 di chuy\u1EC3n trong 3 gi\xE2y sau khi k\u1EBFt th\xFAc hi\u1EC7u
    \u1EE9ng.\n\n\u2022 Design: T\u1EADn d\u1EE5ng \"\"M\xE1u th\u1EA5p\"\" (Berserker)
    \u0111\u1EC3 c\u01B0\u1EDDng h\xF3a \"\"Ph\u1EA3n \u0111\xF2n\"\" (Vanguard).\""
